nternal matter for your sector. The thing is, Nameless, you helped me out with many things, including Little Si.","displayText":"Indeed, it IS an internal matter for your sector. The thing is, Nameless, you helped me out with many things, including Little Si.","spans":[{"text":"Indeed, it IS an internal matter for your sector. The thing is, Nameless, you helped me out with many things, including Little Si."}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":160,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false},{"imgId":125,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"posId":4,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}],"heroFace":[{"imgId":160,"faceId":6}]},"next":"cpt_zangyin_03_03#24"},"cpt_zangyin_03_03#24":{"id":"cpt_zangyin_03_03#24","act":24,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1060,"name":"Zangyin","rawName":"Zangyin","isProfessor":false,"faces":[{"imgId":160,"faceId":8}],"dialogPos":1,"lookup":"장음"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_zangyin_03_03#24","rawText":"More importantly, what you wanted in exchange was for Cyclopes to be rebuilt. We're only halfway through — surely you can't make extra demands of me, right?","displayText":"More importantly, what you wanted in exchange was for Cyclopes to be rebuilt. We're only halfway through — surely you can't make extra demands of me, right?","spans":[{"text":"More importantly, what you wanted in exchange was for Cyclopes to be rebuilt. We're only halfway through — surely you can't make extra demands of me, right?"}]}],"stageRaw":{"heroFace":[{"imgId":160,"faceId":8}]},"next":"cpt_zangyin_03_03#25"},"cpt_zangyin_03_03#25":{"id":"cpt_zangyin_03_03#25","act":25,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":125,"name":"Nameless","rawName":"Nameless","isProfessor":false,"dialogPos":3,"lookup":"네임리스"},"units":[{"uid":"cpt_zangyin_03_03#25","rawText":"Extra demands... What kind of misprogrammed nonsense are you spouting?","displayText":"Extra demands... What kind of misprogrammed nonsense are you spouting?","spans":[{"text":"Extra demands... What kind of misprogrammed nonsense ar